 "sentences": [
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "This man ordered a burger.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.774
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "What he got... was a squirrel.",
   "start": 1.994,
   "end": 3.369
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "And somehow, this story is now taught to software teams all over the world.",
   "start": 3.589,
   "end": 8.001
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Here's how it happened.",
   "start": 8.451,
   "end": 9.606
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Meet Ray.",
   "start": 9.826,
   "end": 10.584
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "It's late at night, and Ray is alone at the burger joint, wiping the counter, about to close.",
   "start": 10.804,
   "end": 16.361
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "Then the door creaks open.",
   "start": 16.811,
   "end": 18.225
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "One last customer.",
   "start": 18.445,
   "end": 19.593
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "A sweet old man who just wants a hot burger.",
   "start": 19.813,
   "end": 22.528
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Ray opens the fridge... no ground beef.",
   "start": 22.978,
   "end": 25.456
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Not low.",
   "start": 25.676,
   "end": 26.404
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Gone.",
   "start": 26.624,
   "end": 27.124
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "And Ray remembers his manager's one rule: \"Never turn a customer away.",
   "start": 27.574,
   "end": 32.015
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "Never.\" So Ray gets... creative.",
   "start": 32.235,
   "end": 34.271
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "Earlier that day, he saw something out back.",
   "start": 34.721,
   "end": 37.115
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "A dead squirrel, lying next to the trash can.",
   "start": 37.335,
   "end": 39.83
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "So he skins it.",
   "start": 40.28,
   "end": 41.161
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "Grinds it.",
   "start": 41.381,
   "end": 42.059
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "Grills it.",
   "start": 42.279,
   "end": 42.933
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "And serves it to the old man, who takes the biggest bite of his life.",
   "start": 43.153,
   "end": 47.069
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "Three hours later?",
   "start": 47.519,
   "end": 48.676
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "The old man is in the hospital.",
   "start": 48.896,
   "end": 50.694
  },
  {
   "beat": 9,
   "text": "And the next morning, the headline doesn't say \"Ray.\" It says the name on the sign.",
   "start": 51.144,
   "end": 55.678
  },
  {
   "beat": 9,
   "text": "The whole brand takes the hit.",
   "start": 55.898,
   "end": 57.32
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "Now, did this really happen?",
   "start": 57.77,
   "end": 59.199
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "The story comes from Ken Schwaber, one of the creators of Scrum.",
   "start": 59.419,
   "end": 63.06
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "In 2015, someone asked him if it was real.",
   "start": 63.28,
   "end": 66.698
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "His answer?",
   "start": 66.918,
   "end": 67.687
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "\"It's a legend.\" But it keeps getting told... because every team has served a squirrel.",
   "start": 67.907,
   "end": 72.798
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "Think about it.",
   "start": 73.248,
   "end": 74.073
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "A deadline that can't move.",
   "start": 74.293,
   "end": 75.804
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "Work that doesn't fit.",
   "start": 76.024,
   "end": 77.215
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "And nobody willing to say no.",
   "start": 77.435,
   "end": 79.054
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "So someone quietly cuts quality.",
   "start": 79.274,
   "end": 81.299
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "Skips the tests.",
   "start": 81.519,
   "end": 82.562
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "Ships the bug.",
   "start": 82.782,
   "end": 83.668
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "And hopes nobody notices.",
   "start": 83.888,
   "end": 85.555
  },
  {
   "beat": 12,
   "text": "But someone always notices.",
   "start": 86.005,
   "end": 87.761
  },
  {
   "beat": 12,
   "text": "The customer.",
   "start": 87.981,
   "end": 88.791
  },
  {
   "beat": 12,
   "text": "The team.",
   "start": 89.011,
   "end": 89.686
  },
  {
   "beat": 12,
   "text": "The business.",
   "start": 89.906,
   "end": 90.652
  },
  {
   "beat": 13,
   "text": "So what should Ray have done?",
   "start": 91.102,
   "end": 92.498
  },
  {
   "beat": 13,
   "text": "Three things.",
   "start": 92.718,
   "end": 93.539
  },
  {
   "beat": 14,
   "text": "One.",
   "start": 93.989,
   "end": 94.459
  },
  {
   "beat": 14,
   "text": "Negotiate scope, not quality.",
   "start": 94.679,
   "end": 96.572
  },
  {
   "beat": 14,
   "text": "Fewer items on the menu.",
   "start": 96.792,
   "end": 98.321
  },
  {
   "beat": 14,
   "text": "Never a squirrel in the bun.",
   "start": 98.541,
   "end": 99.947
  },
  {
   "beat": 15,
   "text": "Two.",
   "start": 100.397,
   "end": 100.849
  },
  {
   "beat": 15,
   "text": "Serve the most valuable thing first.",
   "start": 101.069,
   "end": 103.108
  },
  {
   "beat": 15,
   "text": "A smaller order of real food beats a full tray of disaster.",
   "start": 103.328,
   "end": 107.238
  },
  {
   "beat": 16,
   "text": "Three.",
   "start": 107.688,
   "end": 108.222
  },
  {
   "beat": 16,
   "text": "Say it early.",
   "start": 108.442,
   "end": 109.274
  },
  {
   "beat": 16,
   "text": "The moment the beef looked low, that was the time to speak up.",
   "start": 109.494,
   "end": 112.84
  },
  {
   "beat": 16,
   "text": "Not at midnight.",
   "start": 113.06,
   "end": 114.034
  },
  {
   "beat": 17,
   "text": "Because when time runs out, you can cut the menu.",
   "start": 114.484,
   "end": 117.351
  },
  {
   "beat": 17,
   "text": "But never... serve the squirrel.",
   "start": 117.571,
   "end": 119.112
  }
 ],
